    "sections": {
        "description": "News Storm is a clean and modern WordPress theme built for news, magazine, blog, and portal websites. It features a simple, user-friendly design with flexible layout options and easy customization through color settings and widget areas. The theme is optimized for speed and SEO, helping your website load quickly and perform better in search engines. Its fully responsive design ensures a smooth browsing experience on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Whether you're running an online magazine, news portal, personal blog, or content-focused website, News Storm provides a professional and reliable foundation for your content. Check the theme documentation at: https://docs.ascendoor.com/docs/news-storm/ and demo at: https://demos.ascendoor.com/news-storm/"
    },
